$date 2026-11-12T10:10:11 $end
$version fda debug_core (brief 50A) $end
$comment With COUNT set to 0x8421 and DUTY set to 0x40, record led and phase for one whole PWM period starting when phase wraps to 0: no cycles before the trigger, 1023 after. Then read DUTY and COUNT back. $end
$timescale 10000 ps $end
$scope module capture $end
$var wire 8 ! phase $end
$var wire 16 " led $end
$var wire 1 # TRIGGER $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
